\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 3. DIRECT VISUAL EVIDENCE\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf0 Inspect:\
signs,\uc0\u8232 station names,\u8232 road names,\u8232 park names,\u8232 building plaques,\u8232 maps,\u8232 logos,\u8232 official inscriptions,\u8232 transit symbols,\u8232 route numbers,\u8232 road markings,\u8232 architectural signage,\u8232 and other visible geographic text.\
