\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 4. VISUAL CANDIDATES ARE ONLY HYPOTHESES\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf0 When direct evidence is absent, several possible locations may be considered internally.\
Compare:\
architectural massing,\uc0\u8232 roof geometry,\u8232 tower placement,\u8232 window rhythm,\u8232 bridge structure,\u8232 shoreline geometry,\u8232 street layout,\u8232 mountain relationship,\u8232 vegetation,\u8232 waterfront structure,\u8232 adjacent buildings,\u8232 rail infrastructure,\u8232 road configuration,\u8232 and skyline context.\
Do not choose the most famous candidate simply because it resembles the photograph.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 FAME IS NOT EVIDENCE.
\f3\b0 \

\f0\b STYLE IS NOT LOCATION EVIDENCE.
\f3\b0 \
Traditional Chinese architecture does not automatically mean Hangzhou.\
A classical garden does not automatically mean Suzhou.\
A lake does not automatically mean West Lake.\
Japanese architecture does not automatically mean Kyoto.\
A European street does not automatically mean Paris.\
A pagoda does not automatically prove a specific pagoda.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
